<title>CANADA: Canada C$1.3 bln bond due 2027 yields 7.310 pct.</title>
<headline>Canada C$1.3 bln bond due 2027 yields 7.310 pct.</headline>
<dateline>TORONTO 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Government of Canada said its C$1.3 billion auction of 8.0 percent bonds due June 1, 2027 produced the following results:</p>
<p>			     YIELD	 PRICE</p>
<p>		   AVG     7.310     108.340  PCT AT</p>
<p>		   LOW     7.308     108.366  HI YIELD</p>
<p>		   HIGH    7.314     108.289   60.52</p>
<p>The bonds will be dated and delivered on May 1. The outstanding debt of the issue totals C$7.1 billion. Bids from primary dealers totalled C$3,068.24 million, including C$64.74 million non-competitive tenders at the average yield.</p>
<p>((Reuters Toronto Bureau (416) 941-8100))</p>
</text>
